  triage:title "test_run_bb5_assignment.py has no negative/failure-path coverage of the runner helpers, unlike its sibling" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB5-QA-COLIMA-1789266000 (PR #1460 comment, 2026-09-13T00:19:54Z), verdict PASS 0/1/0, reviewed pin 0cbc4adc6. scripts/smoke/test_run_bb5_assignment.py has only two happy-path tests and exercises none of the failure branches of json_value, task_rows, agent_pane, wait_for_pane, cleanup_tasks, inspect_container, render_html, or the scenario_* functions, unlike its sibling test_run_inbound_peer_smoke.py which covers both paths. Not blocking this layer; ruled genuine by fenix as a follow-up hardening item." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "test-coverage" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:source "quality-mgr BB5-QA-COLIMA-1789266000, ruled genuine by fenix" ;
